
# 🔍 SmartSearch - Dynamic User Directory

A fast and responsive React application that allows users to search through a directory in real-time with smooth UI animations.

## 🚀 Features
- **Real-time Search:** Filter users by Name, Role, or Email instantly.
- **Modern UI:** Clean grid layout with premium card designs.
- **Dynamic Animations:** Interactive search bar that expands on focus with a glow effect.
- **Responsive Design:** Works perfectly on Mobile, Tablet, and Desktop.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- **Frontend:** React.js
- **Styling:** Custom CSS / Inline Styles
- **Deployment:** Render

## 💡 What I Learned
- Managing complex states in React.
- Implementing efficient array filtering logic.
- Creating reusable components.
- Handling focus and blur events for better UX.

## 📸 Demo => https://projsmartsearch.onrender.com/
